# Secrets and machine-local state must never be committed: this repo is
# public. The canonical secret store lives OUTSIDE the repo, in
# ~/.config/secrets/ (see shell/secrets.sh). These patterns are only a
# safety net in case a key is dropped into the working tree by mistake;
# .githooks/pre-commit also rejects such files when staged.
# (Templates stay committable: *.example is exempt in the hook, and git
# still tracks already-tracked files regardless of these patterns.)
/local/
/secrets/
*.local
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
